---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-slate-900 text-slate-300 border-t border-slate-800 mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-content mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8">
      <!-- Col 1: Brand & Statement -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M21 16v-2l-8-5V3.5c0-.83-.67-1.5-1.5-1.5S10 2.67 10 3.5V9l-8 5v2l8-2.5V19l-2 1.5V22l3.5-1 3.5 1v-1.5L13 19v-5.5l8 2.5z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="text-lg font-bold text-white tracking-tight">节点推荐网</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed pr-4">
          专注中文网络环境的节点推荐、机场推荐与技术评测指南。坚持实机网络监测与真实资费核验，为跨境办公、AI开发、流媒体娱乐用户提供客观、中立、具备参考价值的选购指南。
