        <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">
          <p>官方域名：<span class="text-brand-400 font-mono">jiediantuijian.shop</span></p>
          <p class="mt-1">数据核验周期：每周定期更新与晚高峰连通性抽测</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: 精选专题 -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">推荐与排行</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/ranking/overall/" class="hover:text-white transition">综合实力排行榜</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ranking/value/" class="hover:text-white transition">性价比单价排行榜</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ranking/stable/" class="hover:text-white transition">稳定性专线排行榜</a></li>
          <li><a href="/recommend/stable/" class="hover:text-white transition">稳定专线机场精选</a></li>
          <li><a href="/recommend/budget/" class="hover:text-white transition">低预算平价机场</a></li>
          <li><a href="/recommend/ai/" class="hover:text-white transition">ChatGPT与AI专用</a></li>
          <li><a href="/recommend/streaming/" class="hover:text-white transition">4K流媒体解锁</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: 教程与工具 -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">教程与工具</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/compare/" class="hover:text-white transition">机场节点在线对比</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/windows/" class="hover:text-white transition">Windows 客户端教程</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/android/" class="hover:text-white transition">Android 手机端配置</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/ios/" class="hover:text-white transition">iOS 小火箭配置教程</a></li>
